      "answer_outline": "A strong answer demonstrates a proactive approach to on-call duties, such as creating thorough runbooks, setting up meaningful alerts, and maintaining a calm, systematic troubleshooting process. The candidate should express an understanding of the high stakes involved in port operations and a commitment to service ownership.",
